## Your health is our Priority

We don’t take your health lightly, The Rosewood Clinic incorporates a 4-step patient management process.

[Our services](https://www.therosewoodclinic.com/services/ "Services")

01

### Data Gathering

![](https://www.therosewoodclinic.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/luke-chesser-JKUTrJ4vK00-unsplash-uai-1080x462.jpg)

We go deep – a detailed patient intake questionnaire, biometric measurements, and a review (if applicable) of past patient medical records, and blood tests.

02

### Consultation & Tests

![](https://www.therosewoodclinic.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/pexels-thirdman-7659567-uai-1280x548.jpg)

The 1+ hour consultation with our doctor ensures we understand the symptoms and know what diagnostic tests are needed.

03

### Treatment

![](https://www.therosewoodclinic.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/healthy-food-functional-medicine-kuala-lumpur-uai-1128x483.jpg)

With new data at our fingertips, our doctors will personalise a treatment plan to achieve your health goals.

04

### Evaluation & Review

![](https://www.therosewoodclinic.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/healthcare-worker-or-caregiver-visiting-senior-man-2022-11-12-14-22-22-utc-scaled-1-uai-1128x483.jpg)

We monitor, review, and optimise to achieve your health goals.

## What is Functional Medicine?

We’ll let Dr Iman Thalia, The Rosewood Clinic’s Medical Director & Functional Medicine doctor explain how by taking a holistic approach to health, functional medicine has helped thousands of people around the world achieve better health outcomes. By treating the whole person, not just their symptoms, functional medicine practitioners are able to identify underlying issues that may have been overlooked by traditional medicine.

